---
/**
 * A markdown table, in a box that scrolls on its own.
 *
 * A wide table is the classic way a docs page ends up with a horizontal
 * scrollbar on the whole document — which on a right-to-left page is worse
 * still, because the page then starts scrolled. The overflow belongs to the
 * table, not to the body.
 */
---

<div class="table-scroll">
  <table><slot /></table>
</div>
